{"id":"gnfsxysg","parent":"0lp4ejqb","ord":"a0","title":"buy a computer","desc":"User wants options for a Linux computer that runs NixOS (2026-09-11). Budget, purchase country, laptop vs desktop, workload, and whether NixOS must be preinstalled are unknown. No purchase decision yet.\n\nInitial shortlist researched 2026-09-11: Framework Laptop 13 AMD Ryzen AI 300 (default laptop suggestion; Framework lists NixOS 26.05 as stable and community-supported, Wi-Fi/Bluetooth working out of box, fingerprint requiring setup: https://frame.work/laptop13?tab=linux); ThinkPad T14 AMD Gen 5 (dedicated nixos-hardware module https://github.com/NixOS/nixos-hardware/tree/master/lenovo/thinkpad/t14/amd/gen5); refurbished ThinkPad T14 AMD Gen 2/3 as budget candidates (both listed in https://github.com/NixOS/nixos-hardware/blob/master/README.md); Framework Desktop Ryzen AI Max as compact desktop candidate (32/64/128GB configurations https://frame.work/desktop). These are candidates for installing NixOS, not a claim of NixOS preinstallation. Exact regional prices and stock not checked.","created":"2026-09-11T11:31:28-04:00","changed":"2026-09-11T11:32:49-04:00","custom":{"chat-agent-session":"codex:01a09118-bd7b-71c1-a7b0-a97bfd0360dc"}}
